+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                  REACT FRONTEND                                   |
|   (Vite + Tailwind CSS / React WebCam / Canvas Overlay / WebSocket Audio Client)  |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
                                   │            ▲
                      REST APIs    │            │  WebSockets
               (Auth / Config / DB)│            │  (Live Frames & Bounding Boxes)
                                   ▼            │
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                 FASTAPI BACKEND                                   |
|  /api/v1/health   │  /ws/vision-feed    │  /ws/audio-stream   │  /api/v1/query    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
       │                   │                      │                   │
       ▼                   ▼                      ▼                   ▼
 +-----------+     +---------------+      +---------------+    +--------------+
 | PostgreSQL|     |  YOLO / YOLOE |      | Whisper / TTS |    | Ollama / GPT |
 | (Users/Log)     | (Vision Matrix)      | (Audio Pipe)  |    | & Qdrant Vector|
 +-----------+     +---------------+      +---------------+    +--------------+

Structure
---------
vision-assist/
├── docker-compose.yml
├── README.md
├── secrets/                     <-- Git-ignored secrets directory
│   ├── postgres_password.txt
│   └── qdrant_api_key.txt
│
├── backend/                     <-- FastAPI / ML Service Domain
│   ├── Dockerfile
│   ├── requirements.txt
│   ├── main.py                  <-- FastAPI Entrypoint & Uvicorn runner
│   └── app/
│       ├── __init__.py
│       ├── api/                 <-- HTTP REST Routes & WebSocket Endpoints
│       │   ├── __init__.py
│       │   ├── router.py        <-- Combines all route modules
│       │   ├── vision_routes.py <-- /ws/vision WebSocket
│       │   ├── audio_routes.py  <-- /ws/audio WebSocket
│       │   ├── auth_routes.py   <-- Replaces login_view.py (REST endpoints: /api/v1/auth/login, /register)
│       │   └── chat_routes.py   <-- REST endpoints for conversation/DB
│       ├── core/                <-- Config, Security, DB Connections
│       │   ├── config.py        <-- Secret loading & environment settings
│       │   ├── database.py      <-- PostgreSQL / SQLAlchemy session setup
│       │   ├── security.py       <-- Password hashing (SHA-256 / bcrypt), JWT tokens
│       │   └── logging_config.py
│       ├── engines/             <-- Core ML/AI Domain Logic (Migrated from old /app)
│       │   ├── vision/          <-- YOLO / YOLOE detection engines
│       │   ├── voice/           <-- Whisper STT & TTS pipeline
│       │   └── ml/              <-- Ollama, OpenAI, Query Classifier, Qdrant
│       ├── services/
│       │   └── user_service.py    <-- Replaces user_mgr / UserManager logic (DB queries, user CRUD)
│       └── models/              <-- SQLAlchemy DB Models & Pydantic Schemas
│           ├── db_models.py     <-- User, UserLogin, and Role PostgreSQL schemas
│           └── schemas.py       <-- Pydantic request/response models (UserCreate, UserResponse)
│
└── frontend/                    <-- React / SPA Frontend Domain
    ├── Dockerfile
    ├── package.json
    ├── vite.config.js
    ├── tailwind.config.js
    ├── public/                  <-- Static assets, favicons
    └── src/
        ├── main.jsx             <-- React entrypoint
        ├── App.jsx              <-- Main Dashboard Shell
        ├── components/          <-- Reusable UI Components
        │   ├── VideoFeed.jsx    <-- WebCam + Canvas bounding box painter
        │   ├── AudioRecorder.jsx<-- Microphone capture & waveform visualizer
        │   ├── SystemStatus.jsx <-- Postgres/Qdrant/Ollama health indicators
        │   ├── LoginModal.jsx 
        │   └── ContextPanel.jsx <-- Spatial memory & conversation stream
        ├── hooks/               <-- Custom React Hooks
        │   ├── useVisionWS.js   <-- WebSocket hook for real-time video frames
        │   └── useAudioWS.js    <-- WebSocket hook for audio streaming
        └── services/            <-- Axios / Fetch REST API client helper
            └── api.js

